d, and additional Normal Attack damage."},{"name":"Primordial Jade Cutter","text":"Provides a large CRIT Rate bonus and bonus ATK based on maximum HP. More useful for damage-oriented Qiqi builds than pure healing."},{"name":"Summit Shaper","text":"ATK% and a stackable ATK bonus. Shielding enhances its passive."},{"name":"The Flute","text":"ATK% sword with Normal/Charged Attack hit stacks; modest support value."},{"name":"Favonius Sword","text":"Generates team Energy particles on CRIT hits; needs some CRIT Rate."},{"name":"Festering Desire","text":"Energy Recharge with Skill damage and Skill CRIT Rate bonuses; past-event weapon."},{"name":"Amenoma Kageuchi","text":"Its ATK% stat supports healing, while Succession Seeds restore Energy after using her Burst."},{"name":"Skyrider Sword","text":"Low-rarity Energy Recharge option; Burst grants temporary movement and ATK SPD."}],"a":[{"names":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"text":"Skill hits can grant a team ATK buff, but uptime varies with Herald rotation and range.","stats":"ATK%/ER · ATK% · Healing/ATK%"},{"names":["Ocean-Hued Clam"],"text":"Converts Qiqi's massive healing into additional physical damage.","stats":"ATK%/ER · ATK% · Healing/ATK%"},{"names":["Song of Days Past"],"text":"Turns healing into extra damage for the active character. Team damage option when Clam or Tenacity is less useful.","stats":"ATK%/ER · ATK% · Healing"}],"t":[{"name":"Weird Science","members":["qiqi","Mitya","Yae Miko","Sucrose"],"text":"Qiqi enables Stellar-Conduct and heals, Yae provides off-field Electro damage, and Sucrose shares EM and shreds resistance.","roles":["Healer","Off-field DPS / Enabler","Off-field DPS","EM Buffer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Dolly Pardon?","members":["qiqi","Sandrone","Odette","Mitya"],"text":"Sandrone leads Stellar-Conduct damage while Mitya and Odette provide reaction support, buffs, and additional damage.","roles":["Healer","On-field DPS","Cryo Enabler / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Enabler"]},{"name":"Night Shift","members":["qiqi","Cyno","Odette","Traveler (Cryo)"],"text":"Cyno drives damage while Cryo Traveler and Odette enable Stellar-Conduct and Qiqi provides healing and buffs.","roles":["Healer","On-field DPS","Cryo Enabler / Buffer","Cryo Enabler / Sub DPS"]},{"name":"Watt the Fischl","members":["qiqi","Fischl","Xingqiu","Beidou"],"text":"Qiqi drives on-field attacks while Xingqiu, Fischl, and Beidou unleash coordinated damage and Electro-Charged reactions.","roles":["Healer","Off-field DPS / Battery","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","Off-field DPS"]}],"v":"Healing Priorities: Build ATK and enough ER for healing uptime; use CRIT Rate with Favonius.\nEnergy Support: Favonius or Sacrificial Sword improve utility. ATK swords can increase healing.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Support"],"about":"Qiqi is a Cryo healer who provides consistent healing, Cryo application, and Stellar-Conduct support.","pros":["Massive Healing","Strong Sustain","Cryo Application","Team Utility"],"cons":["High Energy Needs","Limited Battery","Low Damage"],"weapons":["Skyward Blade","Primordial Jade Cutter","Summit Shaper","The Flute","Favonius Sword","Festering Desire","Amenoma Kageuchi","Skyrider Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best Overall"},{"sets":["Ocean-Hued Clam"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support Alternative"},{"sets":["Song of Days Past"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"}],"main":["ATK% / Energy Recharge","ATK%","Healing Bonus / ATK% / Crit Rate"],"stats":["ATK: 2,300+","Energy Recharge: 180% - 200%","Crit Rate: 50%+"],"vars":[{"title":"Clam Healing Damage","role":"Healer","weapons":["Skyward Blade","Favonius Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Ocean-Hued Clam"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% and Healing Bonus; ER helps Burst uptime.","teams":"Team needing high sustained healing.","when":"Convert large healing output into Ocean-Hued Clam damage.","cond":"Clam bubble damage is capped and physical.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Tenacity Support","role":"Healer / S